flowchart TD
    U[User submits job description] --> A[LangGraph Matching Agent]
    A --> C[MCP Client: initialize and discover tools]
    C <--> S[Filesystem MCP Server]
    S --> R[resources/list and resources/read]
    S --> T[tools/list and tools/call]
    T --> F[Resume filesystem]
    F --> B[batch_process resumes]
    B --> A
    A --> M[Keyword scoring and ranking]
    M --> O[Ranked candidate results]
    W[watch_directory tool] --> S
